WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:04.568
Preparing for TEF Canada, but don't
want to pay for a course?

00:04.568 --> 00:05.739
Meet OpenExam Hub.

00:05.739 --> 00:08.797
Free study plans, built from
official material.

00:09.677 --> 00:13.282
Hit "Build my free plan" and create a
free account in seconds.

00:13.762 --> 00:17.791
Your account saves your progress, and
keeps the AI free for everyone.

00:18.316 --> 00:22.191
Now pick your exam, your target level,
and how many days you've got.

00:24.447 --> 00:25.625
Not sure of your level?

00:25.625 --> 00:27.775
Take the quick twelve-question self-check.

00:28.491 --> 00:31.539
Reading, listening, grammar, even
writing and speaking.

00:34.391 --> 00:37.975
You get an estimated level, and the
skills to work on first.

00:39.721 --> 00:40.890
Then build your plan.

00:40.890 --> 00:44.287
Every source is official,
copyright-checked and link-checked.

00:44.834 --> 00:45.468
Here it is.

00:45.468 --> 00:48.984
Today's tasks come first, and all
thirty days are mapped out.

00:49.575 --> 00:50.538
Finished a task?

00:50.538 --> 00:51.261
Tick it off.

00:51.999 --> 00:54.615
Then track your pace and your
readiness by skill.

00:55.190 --> 00:58.108
Every resource is free,
official, and link-checked.

01:01.566 --> 01:04.134
And you can grab fresh
practice items any time.

01:08.194 --> 01:10.438
Free, official, and open source.

01:10.438 --> 01:13.314
Start your plan today at openexamhub.org.
